      "uid": "zhcn:6f54602aa54a1641b1daeb06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──去年的有马纪念，\n她跟‘白色闪电’玉藻十字，\n跑出了令人瞠目结舌的比赛！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "26290bd05a6333fcab3a219363a6844fac8540ff640b1bba92469e7f628272ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
