      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“那正是所谓的‘世纪之战’呢！\n我怀疑今后是否还有幸看到如此刺激的对决？\n可说是最棒的一战！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "496a7d401bc435971c4e49506c25ac687587b2fa4bb8d6f4770b8a37606eea5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
